 AUDIT — what the code review found before writing anything
 ---------------------------------------------------------
2026-07-27 12:31:00 — [INFO] Dev session started — full project audit
2026-07-27 12:31:20 — [INFO] Repository cloned and reviewed: 2 files, 8 commits
2026-07-27 12:32:05 — [CRITICAL] Trend detection is measuring noise, not trend
2026-07-27 12:32:06 — [CRITICAL] Cause: generate_play_history() rebuilds 30 days of
                                 random data on every run. There is no persistence,
                                 therefore no history, therefore no real trend.
                                 Querying the same artist twice returns GROWING and
                                 then DECLINING. This invalidates the core feature.
2026-07-27 12:32:40 — [ERROR]    Dead retry logic: simulate_api_call() logs
                                 "retrying..." but never retries anything
2026-07-27 12:33:02 — [ERROR]    calculate_metrics() assumes HISTORY_DAYS is even;
                                 an odd window silently misaligns both halves
2026-07-27 12:33:25 — [WARNING]  Emoji output routed to console StreamHandler with
                                 no encoding guard — UnicodeEncodeError on Windows cmd
2026-07-27 12:33:48 — [WARNING]  README promises "numeric menus"; no menu exists.
                                 The agent runs a hardcoded list of 7 queries
2026-07-27 12:34:10 — [WARNING]  logs/app.log committed to version control
2026-07-27 12:34:12 — [WARNING]  No .gitignore, no requirements.txt, no tests
2026-07-27 12:34:30 — [INFO]     Audit complete: 3 blocking defects, 5 minor issues
2026-07-27 12:35:00 — [INFO]     Roadmap agreed with author: 5 phases
2026-07-27 12:35:30 — [INFO]     Decision — persistence format: JSON on disk
                                 (chosen over SQLite for readability and ease of
                                 explanation; the store is abstracted so migrating
                                 later touches one module only)

