 DECISION — scope of the web interface
 -------------------------------------
2026-07-29 22:02:00 — [INFO] Author requested a browser interface that shows the
                             project, the GitHub profile, and actually runs it
2026-07-29 22:03:00 — [INFO] Three options weighed:
                               Pyodide     — real Python via WebAssembly
                               JS rewrite  — fast to load, but a parallel copy of
                                             the logic and a second source of truth
                               Flask       — real Python, but needs a server running
2026-07-29 22:04:00 — [INFO] Decision: Pyodide. Running the actual package matters
                             more than saving the initial download. A JavaScript
                             reimplementation would stop being the project.
2026-07-29 22:04:30 — [INFO] Hosting: docs/ on GitHub Pages

